1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:03,535
New to logic grid puzzles?
Here's how they work.

2
00:00:04,250 --> 00:00:07,722
Every square in the grid pairs
two things from the story.

3
00:00:08,250 --> 00:00:11,934
If a clue says two things
can't go together, mark an X.

4
00:00:12,750 --> 00:00:15,275
If they must go together, mark
an O.

5
00:00:15,750 --> 00:00:20,490
Each row has exactly one O, so
the rest of that row is all X.

6
00:00:21,250 --> 00:00:24,013
Fill in every square, and the
case is closed!

7
00:00:24,750 --> 00:00:27,871
Try one free at
thelogicgrid.com!

